# #5840 S4, a5e2e2ef's R2 extended and R5: a claim or bump in flight at the counted close
# is relinquished too, its epoch max-merged into the relinquished epoch.
MODULE: LiveDonorProgressRelinquishRecordsOnlyInstalledEpoch
TARGET: LiveDonorProgress
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the relinquish records only the installed epoch, so a write re-stamped at an in-flight floor bump's epoch is refused above the relinquished epoch with no current epoch and supersedes the live donor (R7)
PERTURBS: SplitPersist, LiveClaimDone
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithRestart = FALSE

--- FIND
            /\ relEpoch' = Max2(relEpoch, Max2(lEpoch, lClaim))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: only the installed epoch is recorded.
            /\ relEpoch' = Max2(relEpoch, lEpoch)
--- END

--- FIND
             [] OTHER -> /\ relEpoch' = Max2(relEpoch, lClaim)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a discarded claim's epoch is not recorded.
             [] OTHER -> /\ relEpoch' = relEpoch
--- END
